# Changes to the release key policy, the release validators, the CI checks,
# the workflows and actions, and attributes need a review by the release
# maintainers (the rulesets require code-owner review on the protected
# branches). GitHub applies an owner only once the team has write access.
/contrib/keys/ @Qbit-Org/release-maintainers
/ci/release/ @Qbit-Org/release-maintainers
/ci/checks/ @Qbit-Org/release-maintainers
/.github/workflows/ @Qbit-Org/release-maintainers
/.github/actions/ @Qbit-Org/release-maintainers
.gitattributes @Qbit-Org/release-maintainers
/.github/CODEOWNERS @Qbit-Org/release-maintainers
